  "description": "MAUI Performance Overlay – lightweight, drag-and-move performance HUD for .NET MAUI apps.\n\t\t\tDisplays real-time FPS, Frame Time, CPU usage, Memory usage, Threads, GC Collections, Allocations/sec, Battery consumption (Android only), and Networking stats (total requests, bytes sent/received, average request time).\n\t\t\tProvides an overall score for app performance. Load time per components is also tracked and displayed. Ideal for diagnostics and profiling MAUI applications on Android, iOS, MacCatalyst, Tizen, and Windows.\n\t\t\tEasily integrates into your app to monitor performance and responsiveness.",
